8.Path:/configuration/route-isis/isis-instances/isis-isis/isis-instances/isis-instance/isis-intfs/isis-intf-attr/link-metric/inc-metric/increase-value/inc-value. The default value is abolished.
9.Path:/state/route-isis/isis-adjacencies/isis-adjacency. Add some selects.
10.Path:/state/route-isis/isis-circuits/isis-circuit. Add some selects.
11.Path:/configuration/route-isis/isis-instances/isis-intfs/ipv4-bfd-negotiation/min-tx. The range is changed , and customized by the  performance parameter.
12.Path:/configuration/route-isis/isis-instances/isis-intfs/ipv4-bfd-negotiation/min-rx. The range is changed , and customized by the  performance parameter.
13.Path:/configuration/route-isis/isis-instances/isis-intfs/ipv6-bfd-negotiation/min-tx. The range is changed , and customized by the  performance parameter.
14.Path:/configuration/route-isis/isis-instances/isis-intfs/ipv6-bfd-negotiation/min-rx. The range is changed , and customized by the  performance parameter.' ;
  }

